  "binding": [
    "Picker builder 0x1401003f0 stores Action discriminant 10 at 0x140100738, then invokes the Coop label closure at 0x1401007d1.",
    "FunctionSystem vtable 0x145ef2648 has run 0x14011b850 at +0 and initializer 0x14011afb0 at +56.",
    "Initializer 0x14011b314 loads Coop TypeID 0x145f01550; call 0x14011b322 uses canonical resource getter 0x1401570a0. Return ID is saved at frame+0x120 then tupleState+0x170 at 0x14011b477..0x14011b485.",
    "Run 0x14011bb0c resolves tupleState+0x170 to resource data+0x10, stores it at stack+0x208, then builds ResMut at stack+0x168. Its pointer goes to caller stack+0x48 at 0x14011bf61; call 0x14011bf84 enters handler 0x14010bc00.",
    "Handler entry pushes 64 bytes, allocates 0x2e8 and sets RBP=RSP+0x80; its RBP+0x2f8 equals caller stack+0x48. R11 receives this ResMut, data pointer becomes frame-0x28, change tick pointer frame-0x20, current tick frame+0x170.",
    "Dispatch 0x14010c254 reads the Action byte; signed relative table base 0x145ef3538 cell 10 at 0x145ef3560 leads to 0x14010c8f5.",
    "OPEN 0x14010c8f5..0x14010c911 copies the current change tick and writes only Coop+0x12c=1, then jumps to the input loop at 0x14010be70. No service call or state reset occurs in this branch."
  ],
